WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.368
-Guys, it is time
for the latest edition

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.904
of our "Tonight Show Polls."
Here we go.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:09.542
-♪ Tonight Show Polls ♪

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:10.710
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.311
-This first poll asked,

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:15.048
"What is the greatest threat
facing America today?"

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.418
10% said Iran,
10% said North Korea,

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.153
10% said Russia,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.621
70% said, "Dads joining TikTok."

00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:23.890
-Oh.
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.858
-I agree.

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:28.828
This next poll asked,
"Are you drinking enough water?"

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.397
40% said,
"I could be drinking more."

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:34.266
40% said, "I think
I'm drinking the right amount."

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:36.869
20% said, "What percentage
of White Claw is water?"

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:41.808
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.243
-Oh, my God.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:47.112
-This next poll asked, "Where do
you watch 'Mare of Easttown'?"

00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:50.116
25% said, "On my phone."
-Mm.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.819
-25% said, "In my home."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.688
25% said, "While eating my
hoogie and drinking wooder."

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.758
[ Laughter ]
And 25% said, "Not sure why
yer being so newsey,

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.793
but I'll prolly watch
after getting con-fra-bill

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:05.798
in the baff-room."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:08.100
This next one asks,
"What are your summer plans?"

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.704
2% said, "Going to the beach."

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.073
2% said, "Visiting my family."

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:16.943
96% said, "Trying to remember
what it feels like

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.145
to be around other people
without having a panic attack."

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:23.782
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:25.150
This next poll asked,

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:27.353
"How do you think Joe Biden
is doing as president?"

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:30.022
70% said,
"I'm really pleased so far."

00:01:30.022 --> 00:01:32.859
29% said, "I think
he's doing a horrible job."

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.328
1% said, "Now listen here, Jack,

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:40.332
I once knew a guy named
Spitshine Johansson.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:43.669
He used to shine your shoes
so good you could see if someone

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:46.539
coming in the reflection
was a friend or foe.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.806
And if it was a foe,

00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:49.708
you could kick him in the crotch
before he gotcha!"

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:52.579
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Wow.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.447
So specific.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.815
-Next poll asks,

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.117
"What's your favorite thing
about charcuterie boards?"

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:01.020
25% said,
"They look great on Instagram."

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.356
20% said, "Everyone can eat as
much or little as they want."

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:07.126
55% said, "They're basically
adult Lunchables."

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:09.262
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:11.764
-They basically are.
-White Claw and a Lunchable.

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.432
-The next poll asks,
"Who do you think committed

00:02:13.432 --> 00:02:15.101
the murder in the documentary?"

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.803
40% said, "The husband."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:21.207
20% said, "But I didn't even
say which documentary."

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:23.576
40% said, "Doesn't matter.
It was the husband. Trust me."

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:27.379
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:28.648
And the last poll asked,

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.750
"Who's your favorite member
of Biden's cabinet?"

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.819
100% said,
"I'm gonna be real with you.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.787
I don't know a single member
of Biden's cabinet,

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.289
and I've never been happier."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:39.425
That's all the time we have
for "Tonight Show Polls."

